### ============================
### 商品管理测试
### ============================

### 登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token);
%}


### ============================
### 商品分类
### ============================

### 分类列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/product-categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 新增分类
POST http://localhost:8080/api/product-categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "测试分类"
}


### 修改分类（替换 {id} 为上一条返回的 id）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/product-categories/4
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "测试分类改名",
  "status": 1
}


### 删除分类
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/product-categories/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================
### 商品 CRUD
### ============================

### 商品列表（含关键字搜索）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/list?keyword=键盘&page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 商品列表（按分类筛选）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/list?categoryId=1&page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 新增商品
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "测试商品",
  "code": "P_TEST_01",
  "costPrice": 50.00,
  "salePrice": 99.00,
  "unit": "个",
  "status": 1
}


### 重复编码 → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "重复商品",
  "code": "P_TEST_01",
  "costPrice": 10,
  "salePrice": 20
}


### 商品详情（替换 {id} 为实际 id）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 修改商品（替换 {id} 为实际 id）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "机械键盘-已改",
  "salePrice": 299.00
}


### 删除商品
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================
### DTO 校验测试 → 400
### ============================

### 分类名称为空
POST http://localhost:8080/api/product-categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": ""
}


### 商品名称为空
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "",
  "code": ""
}
